# FlatIO matches a long string near the word "flat", and in yarn.lock that is the checksum of a
# package whose name contains it, such as flat-cache or lodash.flatten. This repository uses no
# Flat.io key.
FlatIO
# TLy matches a long string after the letters "tly", and a base64 integrity hash in yarn.lock can
# contain them itself. This repository uses no T.LY key.
TLy
